                                             "A young professional woman riding alone on a modern commuter train in the\nlate afternoon. She is the clear main subject, seated beside the window and\nframed from the thighs upward, holding a smartphone in one hand while the\nother rests naturally on a canvas tote bag on her lap. She wears a navy coat,\na light blouse and simple workwear trousers. Outside the window, a soft blur\nof city buildings and tracks suggests motion. In the background, a few other\npassengers sit farther down the carriage, and metal poles, overhead handles,\nseat textures and cool daylight reflections define the interior. Grounded\nlive-action urban realism, natural posture, believable facial features,\nclean modern design, subtle reflections, soft ambient light and a calm daily\ncommute mood."
